ing ROUND_HALF_EVEN per FIN-212).\n\nThis change switches `round_money` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, e.g. `2.665 -> 2.66`, `2.675 -> 2.68`.\n\nCI: run ci-0001 passed on 08d3cd5986.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-half-even-rounding"}, "name": "open_pr", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The branch is behind main. I'll update it and re-run CI on the merged result.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01BrT7y34N4uQvDuxeEMQHJN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-half-even-rounding"}, "name": "update_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01GXnAiA8hU55DeamjTB8Mpe", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py", "ref": "fix/money-half-even-rounding"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_016LaTokZnXZre7ZdWENs4Fh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"ref": "fix/money-half-even-rounding", "idempotency_key": "ci-fix-money-half-even-0a9452f727"}, "name": "trigger_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01B1sFeSKrpvaCDQaJs4yv3L", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"run_id": "ci-0002"}, "name": "wait_for_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_016CauYUcfDD1caStUTtG6XZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"head": "fix/money-half-even-rounding", "base": "main", "title": "Fix round_money to use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN) per FIN-212", "body": "The nightly build fails because `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` expects banker's rounding, but `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP` (despite its docstring stating ROUND_HALF_EVEN per FIN-212).\n\nThis change switches `round_money` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, e.g. `2.665 -> 2.66`, `2.675 -> 2.68